        },
        {
          "text": "Man mon abiro gibimaku nico acel i ceng’ maeca, gibiwacu kumae, Wabicamu kwen mwa giwa, man wabikendo kendi mwa giwa: ndhu wek julwong’wa ku nyingi; kab lewic mwa cen.",
          "type": "text",
