          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ceng’ maeca jang Yehova bibedo leng’ man mi dwong’, man nying’ ng’om bibedo ber hai man mi bero ni ju ma giboth mir Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man ebitimbre, nia ng’atu m’udong’ i Sayuni, ku ng’atu m’udong’ i Yerusalem, jubilwong’o leng’, en e ku ba dhanu ceke ma jukiewoi kind ju ma kwo i Yerusalem; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nwang’u Rwoth ulwoko cilo mi nyig Sayuni cen, man eyweyo rimo mi Yerusalem kud i diere, ku tipo mi pokolembe, man ku tipo mi mac m’uwang’. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
